{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/45581676bfb6df82e77364095b503c63.avif?t=1757432259\" width=603 height=181 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A chill idle game where frogs swim, multiply, and sometimes just hang out causing pond chaos. Grow your ecosystem, unlock neat upgrades, and discover all sorts of quirky frog varieties as your pond comes to life.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/a22bc68ea77de620dd58f212349c25cd.poster.avif?t=1757432259\" width=602 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/a22bc68ea77de620dd58f212349c25cd.webm?t=1757432259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/a22bc68ea77de620dd58f212349c25cd.mp4?t=1757432259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/7508ff358f80c4a048bc5b41b5c365af.avif?t=1757432259\" width=603 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Click like a maniac to spawn frogs and earn resources to upgrade your pond! In this oddly relaxing idle game, every frog gets you closer to new upgrades and surprises. Expand your pond, unlock quirky content, and watch your ecosystem grow. One slightly chaotic hop at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/22e31f56877281909f7e70bbe527c3d4.avif?t=1757432259\" width=602 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/58ba0ccf414f021762a2f46a33d53d1d.avif?t=1757432259\" width=603 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/a3df892b62d105305c96d24d02485408.avif?t=1757432259\" width=602 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard earned frog points on a branching skill tree packed with upgrades for every corner of your pond. Whether you aim for maximum efficiency or just want ridiculously fancy frogs, the choice is yours. Every decision shapes your ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927250?t=1757432259","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927250?t=1757432259","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/4c6b969068a60c31690de469e51e625794921188/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757432259","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/4c6b969068a60c31690de469e51e625794921188/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757432259","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/45581676bfb6df82e77364095b503c63.avif?t=1757432259\" width=603 height=181 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A chill idle game where frogs swim, multiply, and sometimes just hang out causing pond chaos. Grow your ecosystem, unlock neat upgrades, and discover all sorts of quirky frog varieties as your pond comes to life.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/a22bc68ea77de620dd58f212349c25cd.poster.avif?t=1757432259\" width=602 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/a22bc68ea77de620dd58f212349c25cd.webm?t=1757432259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/a22bc68ea77de620dd58f212349c25cd.mp4?t=1757432259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/7508ff358f80c4a048bc5b41b5c365af.avif?t=1757432259\" width=603 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Click like a maniac to spawn frogs and earn resources to upgrade your pond! In this oddly relaxing idle game, every frog gets you closer to new upgrades and surprises. Expand your pond, unlock quirky content, and watch your ecosystem grow. One slightly chaotic hop at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/22e31f56877281909f7e70bbe527c3d4.avif?t=1757432259\" width=602 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927250/extras/58ba0ccf414f021762a2f46a33d53d1d.avif?t=1757432259\" width=603 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span 